  backstory: 'By the time Eddie came along, Inday says, Dong had simply run out of names. Eddie talks his way into everything: free taho from the vendor, extra rice at the carinderia, a turn on every basketball court in the barangay. He sells ice candy after school and charms everyone he meets, just like his father.'
